# Real user records (bcrypt password hashes, emails, phone numbers).
# Kept on disk, never published.
#
# The leading "**/" is required: a pattern containing a slash anywhere but the
# end is anchored to the repository root, so a bare "database/users/" silently
# misses the copy that lives under frontend/.
**/database/users/
